    <Description><![CDATA[Element Type SSR-native para un chip/badge de estado como bloque standalone. Diferente de compContentBadge (composition agregable a otros elements) y de elementSynBadge (CDN-hosted). Compone compContentBadge (badgeLabel + badgeVariant) + compDomClass + compDomVariant. Sin props propias. Variations=Culture. Renderer: Views/Partials/Elements/Info/Badge.cshtml.]]></Description>
